  "description": "Turns any topic into a finished narrated motion video — horizontal 16:9 (1920×1080) or vertical 9:16 (1080×1920, Shorts/Reels/TikTok) mp4 — in English, Russian or both, in thirteen looks — hand-drawn doodle, warm garage cartoon, 3D desk UI showcase with a clay mascot, neon-noir explainer, Dota-like dark fantasy, Roblox-like brick game, 8-bit pixel, comic book and five classic stickman styles (minimalist, red-beanie Zeke, prehistoric, cozy, historical) — with velocity-matched transitions, kinetic type, infographics, live app screens and free generated background music, a director's proposal with checks, and AI-video prompt packages (Gemini Omni Flash / Veo / Kling) for every story. Free narration by default (Fish Audio S2.1 free tier via OpenRouter, any Fish voice id). Includes a local studio app (brief → storyboard → render) that Claude watches through a bridge. Use when the user asks for a video, explainer, video essay, YouTube/Reels video, motion graphic, \"ролик/видео на тему …\", says \"проверь приложение / tvhead app / там бриф\", or wants to change, re-voice or re-render such a video.",
